{"unit_id":"nicearrack__dsh-translator#card-zh","repo":"nicearrack/dsh-translator","commit":"5d58b6d8ebddbe1d2b65c9ea847103802a99542d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@nicearrack/dsh-translator 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的划词翻译插件。它在选中文本旁显示浮动按钮，并通过翻译卡片呈现译文；用户可拖动、固定卡片并复制译文。插件提供免费公共翻译接口和 harness 大模型两种引擎，支持自动回退服务、设置目标语言、超时与模型参数，并对重复请求使用缓存。它适合在阅读网页消息、侧栏或输入内容时快速理解片段。使用免费接口时，选中文本会发送给翻译服务；选择模型引擎则调用已配置的 harness LLM。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/core.js:1126-1166","client/core.js:1336-1354","src/index.js:590-625"]}
{"unit_id":"nicearrack__dsh-translator#card-en","repo":"nicearrack/dsh-translator","commit":"5d58b6d8ebddbe1d2b65c9ea847103802a99542d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@nicearrack/dsh-translator adds selected-text translation to DSH Web. A floating button opens a card with copyable results. Choose public services or the harness LLM and set a target language. Answers can be cached. The free API sends text to its provider; the model engine uses the configured LLM.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/core.js:1126-1166","client/core.js:1336-1354","src/index.js:590-625"]}
